:: Livestock Barn
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<set $bus to "livestock">>

You are in the winter barn. There are <<livestock_cows>> lying by the heaters. Hay is gathered in piles placed around the barn. Two farmhands stand watch by the door.
<br><br>

<<livestock_obey_description>>
<br>
<<hunger_description>>
<br><br>

<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "remy">>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutremy>>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 19>>
	<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
	The doors rattle as two farmhands push it open. Remy strides in, and mounts one of the <<livestock_horses>>. <<He>> circles the cattle, rounding them together and pushing them towards the exit.
	<br><br>
	<<if $hunger gte 2000>>
		You feel faint. <span class="red">You're starving.</span> Even the thought of hay is appetising.
		<<gggstress>><<stress 36>>/*<<physique_loss 36>><<willpower 12>>*/
	<<elseif $hunger gte 1600>>
		Your stomach gives an angry rumble. <span class="pink">You're so hungry.</span> Even the thought of hay is appetising.
		<<ggstress>><<stress 18>>
	<<elseif $hunger gte 1200>>
		Your stomach rumbles. <span class="purple">You're hungry.</span> Even the food at the orphanage would be palatable.
		<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<<elseif $hunger gte 800>>
		<span class="blue">You're a bit peckish,</span> but that's tolerable given the situation.
	<<elseif $hunger gte 400>>
		You wish you had something nice to eat, <span class="lblue">but at least you're not hungry.</span>
		<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
	<<elseif $hunger gte 1>>
		<span class="teal">You feel satiated.</span> At least hunger pangs won't be keeping you awake.
		<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">Your stomach is full.</span> At least hunger pangs won't be keeping you awake.
		<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $livestock.muzzle>>
		<<if $livestock.obey gte 60>>
			<<unset $livestock.muzzle>><<set $worn.face.type.push("broken")>><<faceruined>>
			You and the cattle are led back to the barn. A couple of farmhands pull you aside at the entrance, and affix a muzzle around your mouth.
			<br><br>

			"Wait," says Remy's voice from behind. <<He>> rides behind the last of the cattle, and stops beside you. <<He>> looks down. "I think it's proven itself safe," <<he>> says. "The muzzle is unnecessary." <<He>> rides away as the farmhand removes the device, freeing your mouth.
			<br><br>

			You're led into the barn, where a farmhand pushes you into your cell.
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			You and the cattle are led back to the barn. A couple of farmhands pull you aside at the entrance and <span class="purple">affix a muzzle around your mouth.</span>
			<<facewear "bit gag">>
			<br><br>

			You're led into the barn, where a farmhand pushes you into your cell.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		You and the cattle are led back to the barn, where a farmhand pushes you into your cell.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Livestock Cell]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$daily.livestock.power_wash and $liquidcount gte 3 and $livestock.obey lte 15>>
	<<set $daily.livestock.power_wash to true>><<generate1>><<person1>>
	All of a sudden, you feel a hand grab your collar. A <<person>> yanks your head back. <<His>> nose is wrinkled. <<He>> gives you a once over before dragging you towards the door.
	<br><br>
	"You're smelling up the place," <<he>> says. "It's upsetting the others."
	<br><br>
	You look around. Most of the other <<livestock_cows>> are giving you a wide berth. Bits of hay are stuck to your slick skin.
	<br><br>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"I-I'm sorry," you say. "I wish there was a place I cou-could wash off in here..."
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Maybe if you lot let me take a shower, this wouldn't be an issue," you snap.
	<<else>>
		"Sorry," you say. "I'd take a bath if I could."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"Where do you think I'm taking you?" the <<personsimple>> says. "Come on, let's go hose you off, <<girl>>."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Go quietly|Livestock Power Wash Cows Wash]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Fight|Livestock Power Wash Cows Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif Time.hour is 12>>
	<<if (Time.month is 12 or Time.month lte 3) and !$livestock.winter.exam>>
		<<if $livestock.obey gte 30>>
			<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
			The door opens, and Remy walks in. <<He>> looks around until <<his>> eyes rest on you. "There you are, <<girl>>," <<he>> says. "You're long overdue for a check-up. Come here." <<He>> walks closer, holding a leash.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Obey|Livestock Job Obey]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<livestock_obey 1>><<set $phase to "exam">><</link>><<gobey>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Livestock Job Refuse]]>><<npcincr Remy dom -1>><<livestock_obey -1>><<set $phase to "exam">><</link>><<lobey>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
			The door opens, and Remy walks in, flanked by a group of farmhands. <<He>> comes to a stop, but the farmhands continue walking. They form a circle around you. Each carries a long cattle prod.
			<br><br>
			Remy walks closer, holding a leash. "You're long overdue for a check-up. Come here."
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Obey|Livestock Job Disobedient Obey]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<livestock_obey 1>><<set $phase to "exam">><</link>><<gobey>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Livestock Job Disobedient Refuse]]>><<npcincr Remy dom -1>><<livestock_obey -1>><<pain 6>><<set $phase to "exam">><</link>><<lobey>><<gpain>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $livestock.obey gte 30>>
			<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
			The door opens, and Remy walks in. <<He>> looks around until <<his>> eyes rest on you. "There you are, <<girl>>," <<he>> says. "We have a special job for you. Come here." <<He>> walks closer, holding a leash.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Obey|Livestock Job Obey]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<livestock_obey 1>><</link>><<gobey>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Livestock Job Refuse]]>><<npcincr Remy dom -1>><<livestock_obey -1>><</link>><<lobey>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
			The door opens, and Remy walks in, flanked by a group of farmhands. <<He>> comes to a stop, but the farmhands continue walking. They form a circle around you. Each carries a long cattle prod.
			<br><br>
			Remy walks closer, holding a leash. "We have a special job for you. Come here."
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Obey|Livestock Job Disobedient Obey]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<livestock_obey 1>><</link>><<gobey>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Livestock Job Disobedient Refuse]]>><<npcincr Remy dom -1>><<livestock_obey -1>><<pain 6>><</link>><<lobey>><<gpain>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $arousal gte $arousalmax>> <!-- modified field version for the barn -->
	<<orgasm>> Your knees buckle, and you fall to the ground.
	<!-- Modified for Monster People -->
	<<if ($settings.monsterChance gte 1 and ($hallucinations gte 1 or !$settings.monsterHallucinationsOnly))>>
		<<if maleChance() lt random(1, 100)>>
			Cowgirls around the barn look over in confusion.

		<<else>>
			Bullboys around the barn look over in confusion.

		<</if>>
	<<else>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<person1>>
	You lie in the barn, and soon hear footsteps approach. "What have we here?" says a <<personssimple>> voice beside you. "Is it unwell?"
	<br><br>
	"I think it needs a seeing to," says a <<person2>><<person>> as <<he>> crouches beside you, pinning your shoulders to the ground. You hear more farmhands approach.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Livestock Field Gang]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if !$livestock.seen.includes("corner")>>
		<span class="blue">One of the piles of hay is heaped higher than the others, blocking one of the corners.</span> You don't think the farmhands can see it from their seats.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if Time.hour gte 12>>
		Remy's <<livestock_horses>> are huddled together around one of the heaters. The <<livestock_cows>> avoid them.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<farmicon "grass">><<link [[Eat hay (1:00)|Livestock Barn Hay]]>><<pass 60>><<livestock_obey 1>><<transform cow 1>><<hunger -400>><</link>><<gobey>><<lhunger>>
	<br>
	<<exerciseicon>><<link [[Exercise (1:00)|Livestock Barn Exercise]]>><<pass 60>><<tiredness 6>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<gathletics>>
	<br>
	<<heatericon>><<link [[Lay by the heater (0:30)|Livestock Barn Heater]]>><</link>><<gwarmth>>
	<br>
	<<if !$livestock.seen.includes("corner")>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[Examine the corner|Livestock Barn Corner]]>><<set $livestock.seen.push("corner")>><</link>>
	<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 25>>
		<<getouticon "dig">><<link [[Approach the tunnel by the corner|Livestock Barn Dig]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 24 and $physiquesize lte 12000>>
		<<getouticon "dig">><<link [[Approach the tunnel by the corner|Livestock Barn Dig]]>><</link>><<small_text>>
	<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 23 and $physiquesize lte 9000>>
		<<getouticon "dig">><<link [[Approach the tunnel by the corner|Livestock Barn Dig]]>><</link>><<small_text>>
	<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 22 and $physiquesize lte 6000>>
		<<getouticon "dig">><<link [[Approach the tunnel by the corner|Livestock Barn Dig]]>><</link>><<small_text>>
	<<elseif pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		<<ind>><span class="red">You can't dig while your arms are bound.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<getouticon "dig">><<link [[Dig by the corner (1:00)|Livestock Barn Dig]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	/* Commenting this out because it doesn't really provide much of value for the player
	<<if !$livestock.seen.includes("door")>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[Examine front door|Livestock Barn Door]]>><<set $livestock.seen.push("door")>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>> */
	<<if !$livestock.seen.includes("trough")>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[Examine the water trough|Livestock Barn Trough Examine]]>><<set $livestock.seen.push("trough")>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<troughicon>><<link [[Approach the water trough|Livestock Barn Trough]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if Time.hour gte 12>>
		<<animalicon "horse-pick">><<link [[Approach the <<livestock_horses>> (0:01)|Livestock Barn Horse]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Livestock Barn Hay
<<effects>>

You take a mouthful of hay. <<if $cow gte 6>>You miss the taste of grass, but this will do in a pinch.<<else>>It tastes horrible. You're not sure it's edible.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<livestockFieldGrassEvents>>
<<endevent>>

<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Livestock Barn Exercise
<<effects>>

The barn is cramped, but you are able to find a clear path around. You can see the farmhands watching you with amusement. They don't stop you.
<br><br>

Sometimes the <<livestock_cows>> moo at you as you pass them. <<if $cow gte 6>>You moo back.<<else>>You pause to pat a few on the head.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<physique 6>><<athletics 6>>
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 51>>
	<<livestock_overhear>>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Livestock Barn Heater
<<set Weather.Temperature.override.inside = Weather.insideTemperature + 20>><<pass 30>><<effects>>

You join the <<livestock_cows>> lying by the heaters.
<br><br>

The warm air feels nice.<<if $cow gte 6>> You feel lucky that the farmers take such good care of you.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 81>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 cow>>
	A <<person1>><<beasttype>> moos at you. You snuggle closer.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $rng gte 51>>
	<<livestock_overhear>>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Livestock Barn Door
<<effects>>

You approach the front door. The farmhand <<if $livestock.obey lte 10>>grabs your collar.<<else>>looks up at you.<</if>>
<br><br>

"Whoa there, <<girl>>. Are you lost? Out there is too cold for a <<pcow>> like you. Best stay indoors."
<br><br>

Seems you won't be escaping that way.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Livestock Barn Corner
<<effects>>

You creep around the large hay bale. There's a shadowed corner of the barn there. You see a mouse poke its head out from a small hole. It wriggles its whiskers before darting into the bale of hay.
<br><br>

The ground near the wall yields to your prodding. <span class="gold">You should be able to dig here.</span>

/*
$livestock.obey lte 10
<span class="red">The farmhands are keeping an eye on you, though.</span> You won't be able to get away with digging.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>*/

<br><br>
<<link [[Dig a tunnel (1:00)|Livestock Barn Dig]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Go back|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
<br>

<br>

:: Livestock Barn Dig
<<effects>>
You crouch behind the hay. The cold ground takes some time to yield to your hands.

<<if $livestock.dig.barn gte 25 or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 24 and $physiquesize lte 12000) or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 23 and $physiquesize lte 9000) or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 22 and $physiquesize lte 6000)>>
	A shower of dirt covers your face. Light streams from the small hole above you. You've made it to the other side. You can now escape.
<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 20>>
	You've been digging for a while. The tunnel is curving upwards where the dirt is thinner.
<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 12>>
	You can drop into the hole now. You think it's time to dig upwards.
<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 6>>
	You've made some progress. The hole is looking more like a tunnel.
<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 1>>
	You hope nobody notices you. There's a slight indent in the dirt where you've dug.
<<else>>
	You can tell this is going to take some time.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $livestock.dig.barn gte 25 or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 24 and $physiquesize lte 12000) or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 23 and $physiquesize lte 9000) or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 22 and $physiquesize lte 6000)>>
	<<getouticon "hole">><<link [[Escape|Livestock Barn Escape]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<refuseicon>><<link [[Wait|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $livestock.dig.barn gte 24 and $physiquesize lte 12000 or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 23 and $physiquesize lte 9000) or ($livestock.dig.barn gte 22 and $physiquesize lte 6000)>>
	<<getouticon "hole">><<link [[Escape|Livestock Barn Escape]]>><</link>><<small_text>>
	<br>
	<<refuseicon>><<link [[Wait|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<pass 60>>
	<<set $livestock.dig.barn += 1>>
	<<if $rng gte 51>>
		<<livestock_overhear>>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Livestock Barn Trough Examine
<<effects>>
You walk over to the trough lining one of the walls, and peer into the clear water. Some <<livestock_cows>> near you drink from it, causing ripples to appear on the surface. At least it's clean.
<br><br>

You could wash here with enough effort.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn Trough]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Livestock Barn Trough
<<effects>>

You approach the trough. The water is clear and cool to the touch.
<br><br>

You spot your reflection,
<<if Weather.bloodMoon>>
	drowning in blood.
<<elseif Time.dayState is 'night'>>
	a mere silhouette in the dark barn.
<<else>>
	lit by the warm glow of the barn's light fixtures.
<</if>>
<br>
<<if Time.hour is 12>>
	<br>
	It seems Remy is looking for you. <span class="red">You should head out.</span>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<mirroricon>><<link [[Check your reflection|Livestock Barn Mirror]]>><<preMirror>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		<span class="red">You can't wash yourself while your arms are bound.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<skinicon "wash">><<link [[Wash (0:20)|Livestock Barn Wash]]>><<wash>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Livestock Barn Night]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Livestock Barn]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Livestock Barn Mirror
<<effects>>
<<link [[Step away|Livestock Barn Trough]]>><<unset $mirrorMenu>><<unset $bodywritingSet>><</link>>
<br>
<<mirror "reflection">>
<br><br>

:: Livestock Barn Wash
<<effects>>
You wash your body in the trough. The water is clean, at least. It takes a while to scoop the water onto your body and scrub yourself clean.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Livestock Barn Trough]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Livestock Barn Horse
<<effects>>
<!-- Modified for Monster People -->

<<if maleChance() lte 0>>
	<<set _horse_gender to "f">>
<<elseif maleChance() gte 100>>
	<<set _horse_gender to "m">>
<<else>>
	<<set _horse_gender to "b">>
<</if>>

You approach Remy's steeds.

<<if ($settings.monsterChance gte 1 and $hallucinations gte 1) or ($settings.monsterChance gte 1 and !$settings.monsterHallucinationsOnly)>>
	They have the heads and torsos of
	<<if _horse_gender is "f">>
		women.
	<<elseif _horse_gender is "m">>
		men.
	<<else>>
		men and women.
	<</if>>
	Long, well-cared-for manes of hair trail down their backs and chests.
	<<if _horse_gender is "f">>
		They seem unconcerned about their bare breasts.
	<<elseif _horse_gender is "b">>
		The women seem unconcerned about their bare breasts.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Some lay on their stomachs, enjoying the warmth of the heater. Others groom themselves, running fingers through their hair.
<<else>>
	Their fur ranges from pale to dark brown, all well-groomed.
	<br><br>
	Most lay on their stomachs, enjoying the warmth of the heater.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $livestock.horse.reputation gte 2>>
	<<if ($settings.monsterChance gte 1 and $hallucinations gte 1) or ($settings.monsterChance gte 1 and !$settings.monsterHallucinationsOnly)>>
		<span class="green">A few nod in greeting as you approach.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">They clop closer as you approach.</span>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $livestock.horse.reputation gte 1>>
	<<if ($settings.monsterChance gte 1 and $hallucinations gte 1) or ($settings.monsterChance gte 1 and !$settings.monsterHallucinationsOnly)>>
		They watch as you approach. Some look amused.
	<<else>>
		They watch as you approach. They seem calm.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 horse>>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		One of them, a particularly large, dark-haired specimen, faces you as you draw close. "Walk away, cattle," <<bhe>> says, holding <<bhis>> head higher. "This is our heater." The others watch you as well.
	<<else>>
		One of them, a particularly large, dark-haired specimen, unleashes a deep whinny as you approach. It sounds like a warning. The others look up. They're watching you.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $livestock.horse.reputation lt 1 or $livestock.horse.reputation is undefined>>
	<<link [[Be friendly|Livestock Barn Horse Intro]]>><<set $livestock.horse.reputation to 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Be firm|Livestock Barn Horse Intro]]>><<set $livestock.horse.reputation to 1>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Walk away|Livestock Barn]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif Time.betweenHours(19, 20)>>
	It seems Remy is looking for you. <span class="red">You should head out.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Livestock Barn]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<rng>> /* I'm not sure this is nessesary, but I think there's a way to loop through these scenes without alterting RNG, so lets stop that */
	<<if $daily.livestock and $daily.livestock.horses_satisfied is undefined>><<set $daily.livestock.horses_satisfied to 0>><</if>>
	<<clearnpc>><<beastNEWinit 1 horse>>

	<!-- Modified for Monster People -->
	<<if random(1,2) is 1 and $daily.livestock.horses_satisfied lt 6 and $settings.horsesEnabled and ($settings.bestialityEnabled or $monster is 1)>>
		You notice that one <<beasttype>> is standing apart from the rest. <<bHe>> paces back and forth. The <<livestock_cows>> hasten to get out of <<bhis>> way.
		<<set _agitated to 1>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		<span class="red">You can't brush their hair while your arms are bound.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<petshopicon "brush">><<link [[Brush their hair (1:00)|Livestock Barn Horse Brush]]>><<pass 60>><<tending 6>><<stress -6>><</link>><<gtending>><<lstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br>

	<<if _agitated is 1>>
		<<animalicon "horse">><<link [[Investigate the agitated <<beasttype>>|Livestock Cribbing Horse Investigate]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $livestock.food>>
		<<foodstufficon "apple">><<link [[Offer the basket of apples|Livestock Barn Horse Apple Seduction]]>><<pass 1>><<trauma -18>><<endevent>><</link>><<lltrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Livestock Barn]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Livestock Barn Horse Intro
<<effects>>

<<if $monster is 1>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
			"P-please don't be angry," you say. "I just want us to be friends."
		<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
			"The way I see it," you say. "We're sharing this barn together, and should get used to each other."
		<<else>>
			"I mean no harm," you say. "I'm just curious."
		<</if>>
		The centaur laughs.

	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
			"Don't be rude," you say, surprised by how confident you sound. "You're free to lay by whichever heater you want. I just want the same."
		<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
			"You don't scare me," you scoff. "I go where I like."
		<<else>>
			"I'd rather be over here," you say. "Is that going to be a problem?"
		<</if>>
		Arms crossed, the centaur regards you with a level stare.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"You're braver than the rest. Fine, but watch yourself."
<<else>>

	<<if $phase is 1>>
		You keep your pace slow and consistent, but continue to approach. You stretch out your arm, and pat the large horse on the head.
	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		You keep your pace consistent, but don't slow down. You march right up to the large horse, and rest your hand on its head.
	<</if>>
